@startuml roadmap_map
' Spectracs — Roadmap big-picture map: build items, status, and dependencies.
' Companion to ROADMAP.md (the prose backlog). This view answers "what is next and
' what blocks what", which the structural diagrams (db_entities / plugin_model /
' runtime_models / workflow_object_model) intentionally do not.
' Regenerate:  java -jar plantuml.jar -tsvg roadmap_map.puml

title Spectracs — Roadmap map\nstatus + dependencies (as of 2026-07-11, incl. plugin platform M1+M2 done, M3 design)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Sans
skinparam ArrowColor #5A7D8C
skinparam ArrowFontColor #5A7D8C
skinparam rectangle {
  FontColor #222222
  BorderColor #5A5A5A
  roundCorner 12
}

legend right
  |= colour |= meaning |
  | <#C8E6C9>    | done |
  | <#FFE0B2>    | next / unblocked |
  | <#ECEFF1>    | later (blocked by a dependency) |
  | <#E1BEE7>    | deferred design thread |
endlegend

rectangle "FOUNDATIONS" as F #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "**#1  spectrum -> colour**\n✅ done\nSpectrumUtil + SpectralColorUtil.spectrumToColor" as R1 #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**#2  login in header**\n✅ done\naccount control + full-width status bar" as R2 #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**Measurement & evaluation concept**\n✅ done\nSOUND pipeline: T=S/R (LED-independent),\ncolour(T) under D65, hue -> roast verdict\n(concept + physics KB)" as CONCEPT #C8E6C9
}

rectangle "PIPELINE PLAYGROUND  (proof-of-concept)" as PG #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "**Pipeline Playground (PoC)**\n✅ done — master-only dev bench\nLED-synth REFERENCE + oil SAMPLE +\nabsorption + colour + verdict; CFL calibration;\n7-tab bench; regression test + documentation PDF" as PLAY #C8E6C9
}

rectangle "USER & AUTH  (master user)" as UA #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "**#4  User CRUD**\n✅ done\nadd / edit / delete AppUser (master-only)" as R4 #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**#3  Profile <-> User binding + deletion**\n▶ next — BINDING HALF DONE (integration Track B)\nAppUser -> {Plugin, device} seeded ✅;\nmaster UI (serial->AppUser, delete profile) remains" as R3 #FFE0B2
}

rectangle "VIRTUAL DEVICE" as VD #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "**#5  three picture sets**\n✅ done — integration Track A\n3 role image slots + folder picker;\nSPD->ROI encoder (shared vmax) + round-trip test" as R5 #C8E6C9
}

rectangle "WORKFLOW & PLUGIN   (the goal)" as G #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "**#6a  ABSORPTION display**\n✅ done — real absorption plot in the wizard\n(PROCESSING phase, via SpectralWorkflow spine)" as R6a #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**#6  pumpkin-oil workflow + plugin**\n✅ done — integration Tracks B+C\nplugin_sdk + PumpkinOilPlugin + engine +\ninteractive nested-wizard (Measure, plots, verdict)" as R6 #C8E6C9
}

rectangle "CONNECTION & CAPTURE" as CX #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "**CX — connection & calibration UX (milestone 5a)**\n✅ done (on the VIRTUAL device) 2026-07-05\nserial-keyed setup (server-DB migration); master\nauthoring GUIs (Plugin / Profile+auto-calibrate / Setup);\nend-user self-register by serial; header connection indicator" as CXA #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**SM1 — Capture-images dev view**\n✅ done 2026-07-07  (RC-R0 + RC-R1)\nVID:PID->cv2 resolver + CaptureBackend (no MJPG-force);\nSettings>Development live view + save PNG;\nper-camera exposure (ELP CFL=78) + OUR auto-exposure\n(bisection, slider, status-bar progress)" as SM1 #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**SM2 — real calibration off the ELP**\n✅ done 2026-07-08  (RC-R2)\nROI/Hough + detect-peaks on the real cam;\ncalibration auto-exposure + green doublet (542.4)\n+ blue-line ROI (max-channel)" as SM2 #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**Dev measurement bench**\n✅ done + verified 2026-07-08\nmaster Swiss-knife: REF+SAMPLE -> T -> A (no verdict);\nDevSpectralPlugin (transient); seeded masterUserExakta;\nproves the real capture+extraction path\n+ 2026-07-09 build-out: EVALUATION phase, acquisition\ntabs (Captured-image/Spectrum), per-frame progress +\nlive spectra, metric fields, phone-width responsiveness\n+ 2026-07-10 cosmetic/UX polish (S1–S14): frame\nhierarchy, checkbox touch-target, native combo arrow\n(mocked in Wireloom first — see DEV_WORKFLOW.md)" as BENCH #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**SM3 — real measurement**\n▶ next  (RC-R3)\nreal capture in workflow Measure (live-burst->graph);\nmeasurement auto-exposure: expose REF, reuse on SAMPLE" as SM3 #FFE0B2
  rectangle "**★ real measurement after user setup**\ngoal: master sets up a serial unit -> end user\nregisters by serial -> real measurement + evaluation" as MS #ECEFF1
}

rectangle "EVALUATION  (peak-ratio — the verdict)" as EV #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "**Peak-ratio evaluation (P0–P4)**\n✅ done 2026-07-09 — render-only in the bench\ngeneric SpectrumFeatureUtil ops + DevSpectralPlugin\ncomposition (hard-coded pumpkin bands);\ngreenness / pigment / browning / clarity;\nprovisional verdict (no thresholds yet)" as PR #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**P5 — calibrate on real oils**\n▶ next: save metrics + known good/bad oils ->\nquant->qual bounds -> real verdict edges\n(no thresholds ship before this)" as PR5 #FFE0B2
  rectangle "**P6 — pumpkin plugin uses peak-ratio**\nlater: PumpkinOilPlugin composes the SAME ops\n(A/B vs hue); promote consts to shared feature-config" as PR6 #ECEFF1
}

rectangle "SAAS / BILLING  (product)" as SAAS #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "**PayPal payment — milestone 1**\n✅ done + click-through verified 2026-07-06\nsingle 1,00 € SANDBOX payment end-to-end:\nTransaction (server DB) + Orders v2 (stdlib) +\nAccount settings screen (Profile / Payment tabs)" as PAY #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**recurring rental fee — M2**\nlater: €200/month PayPal Subscriptions\n(pay even without use); then M3 live, M4 Android" as PAY2 #ECEFF1
}

rectangle "CROSS-CUTTING  (deferred design threads)" as CC #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "persistable-workflow DB schema\nprereq for persistence in #3 / #6" as CCa #E1BEE7
  rectangle "EvaluationResult -> GUI integration\n✅ done — EvaluationResultRenderer in the wizard\n(swatches + verdict)" as CCb #C8E6C9
  rectangle "PDF report + email\n(PDF prototype: Playground eval test)" as CCc #E1BEE7
  rectangle "LED-combination optimisation\n(future: search a flatter reference)" as CCd #E1BEE7
  rectangle "**test-suite hygiene debt**\nbacklog (non-blocking) — 3 pre-existing test\nfailures: stale calib-DB fixture (T1),\nmodal-dialog hang blocks the suite (T2),\nstale nav-glyph assertion (T3)\nSPEC_test_hygiene_debt.md" as CCe #E1BEE7
}

rectangle "PLUGIN PLATFORM  (the convergence theme)" as PP #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "**M1 — plugin-driven convergence**\n✅ done 2026-07-10\nshared render visitor + WorkflowPhaseRenderer (steps->tabs);\nview-model vocab extended (plot traces/bands/markers,\nSpectrumCaptureView/CaptureView); EVAL+PROC plugin-declared;\nbench plugin selector (Dev/Pumpkin); wizard converged" as M1 #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**M2 — plugin-driven PDF report**\n✅ done 2026-07-11 (SPEC_bench_pdf_export.md)\nQt-free MatplotlibWorkflowRenderer (2nd visitor target);\nReport step-tab, preview = PDF; isShownInReport curates;\nwhole-Workflow workflow.json + capture PNGs via pypdf;\ngeneric per-view-model toJson/fromJson; fit-to-width\npreview + 'Open bigger'; CaptureView chrome flags;\nLIS -> SENAITE deferred" as M2 #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**M3 — plugin distribution**\nlater/design (SPEC_plugin_distribution.md)\nseparate repo + DB-stored SIGNED source, client load;\nplugin_sdk = versioned API; PluginRegistry" as M3 #ECEFF1
}

' ---- plugin platform ----
BENCH --> M1 : generic host over the plugin
R6 ..> M1 : both hosts converge
M1 --> M2 : render seam -> matplotlib target
M1 --> M3 : plugin becomes a droppable unit
PR ..> M2 : evaluation content -> report
M2 ..> CCe : surfaced during verification

' ---- dependency / unblocks edges ----
R1 --> R6  : evaluation body
CONCEPT --> PLAY : implemented by
PLAY --> R5 : synthesis recipe
PLAY ..> R6a : pipeline proven
PLAY ..> CCd : the tool to explore
R4 --> R3  : users must exist first
R3 --> R6  : AppUser -> {Profile, Plugin}
R5 --> R6  : realistic end-to-end
R6a ..> R6 : milestone feeds full build
CCa ..> R3
CCa ..> R6
R6 ..> CCb
R6 ..> CCc

' ---- connection & capture ----
R3 ..> CXA : re-keyed on SERIAL (not username)
R6 --> CXA : plugin+device bound per serial
SM1 --> SM2 : resolver + backend + exposure
CXA --> SM2 : serial unit to calibrate
SM1 --> BENCH : capture + auto-exposure
SM2 --> BENCH : real calibration
CXA --> BENCH : calibrated serial unit
BENCH ..> SM3 : proves capture+extraction
SM2 --> SM3 : calibrated real device
SM3 --> MS : real measurement
CXA --> MS : user setup

' ---- evaluation (peak-ratio) ----
BENCH --> PR : EVALUATION phase added
CONCEPT ..> PR : physically-specific successor to hue
PR --> PR5 : render -> calibrate
PR5 --> PR6 : real edges -> plugin verdict
R6 ..> PR6 : the pumpkin plugin wires it in

' ---- saas / billing ----
R4 --> PAY : needs AppUser (Transaction FK)
PAY --> PAY2 : proves the pipe

@enduml
